Package: SummarizedHeatmap
Title: Heatmaps for SummarizedExperiment Objects
Version: 0.99.0
Authors@R:
    person("Bradley", "Blaser", email = "bradley.blaser@osumc.edu",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-3168-5423"))
Description: Represents clustered assays and their row and column annotations
    as a SummarizedExperiment-derived object. Heatmap components are returned
    as ordinary ggplot2 plots and can be composed and customized with
    patchwork.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
biocViews: Software, Clustering, Visualization
